# TLS material for the local HTTPS server. NEVER commit these.
# A previous commit published the CA private key to a public repo; because the
# CA is installed as a trusted root on the phone, that key could mint a
# trusted certificate for ANY domain, not just this project. History was
# rewritten to remove it and the CA regenerated. Regenerate locally instead —
# see README.
certs/
*.key
*.pem